{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我说，果然还是分手吧」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4146", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都说了等一下」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但我真的没办法了……」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4147", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没想到第二天情况反而恶化了。", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每次和纱凪说话，都能感到距离越来越远。", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管如此，我们却无法对彼此保持礼貌的态度。", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且，我现在也没办法再叫你“混蛋瓜生”了啊」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4148", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要我叫你“乾同学”也怪不好意思的」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在不知不觉中我们的关系就已经改变了啊……」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4149", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说到底，让别的男生直呼名讳什么的，\\n　瓜……啊啊，真是够了，也就只有新吾了……」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": "「说到底，让别的男生直呼名讳什么的，　瓜……啊啊，真是够了，也就只有新吾了……」", "plain_idx": 169, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4150", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是交往开始后再变得这么客气，\\n　总感觉怪怪的」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": "「要是交往开始后再变得这么客气，　总感觉怪怪的」", "plain_idx": 172, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4151", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4152", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呆在角落的纱凪小心翼翼地向我走来。", "text_idx": 178, "plain": "呆在角落的纱凪小心翼翼地向我走来。", "plain_idx": 178, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，她在我能触摸到的距离停了下来。", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只有我们俩的时候就稍微亲密一点，\\n　在他人面前就还是和往常一样吧……」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": "「只有我们俩的时候就稍微亲密一点，　在他人面前就还是和往常一样吧……」", "plain_idx": 181, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4153", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个……也没有必要过于亲密……」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4154", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和以前一样，她还是不喜欢在别人面前表现得太亲密。", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，现在这样做可以吧？」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4155", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻摸了摸纱凪的头，又用手指触碰了她的脸颊。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪并没有逃避，而是一直盯着我的脸。", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样摸你头的话，还会生气吗？」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽、虽然不会生气……\\n　只是我不知道这个时候应该摆出什么表情」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "「虽、虽然不会生气……　只是我不知道这个时候应该摆出什么表情」", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4156", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有就是，只是我一直被你抚摸的话，\\n　就有种输给了你的感觉」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": "「还有就是，只是我一直被你抚摸的话，　就有种输给了你的感觉」", "plain_idx": 196, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4157", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「连这些地方也要分个胜负啊」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这对我来说很重要。嗯唔，该怎么说呢……」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4158", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾有没有什么想让我摸摸的地方？」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4159", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是给你的特别服务，任选一个想要被摸的地方吧。\\n　不用客气，说出来看看？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": "「这是给你的特别服务，任选一个想要被摸的地方吧。　不用客气，说出来看看？」", "plain_idx": 205, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4160", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊不，我就……」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了好了，说出来听听。\\n　我会很温柔地给你摸摸看的～」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": "「好了好了，说出来听听。　我会很温柔地给你摸摸看的～」", "plain_idx": 209, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4161", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然这样说真的有点摸不着头脑。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我真的会很温柔的，没关系哦？」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4162", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我倒是不担心这个」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或者说，摸摸头之类？", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我能想到的被女孩子抚摸会感到开心的地方，\\n就那么几个。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "我能想到的被女孩子抚摸会感到开心的地方，就那么几个。", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有，摸头挺困难的所以不行！\\n　…主要是身高差的问题」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "「还有，摸头挺困难的所以不行！　…主要是身高差的问题」", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4163", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这下越来越头大了。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，摸哪里好？快说吧」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4164", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔～嗯……」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，你不用再摸我的脑袋了啦」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4165", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那这个问题就当作家庭作业，下次再告诉你吧」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，居然逃走了。\\n　哎，真是个没骨气的家伙……」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": "「啊，居然逃走了。　哎，真是个没骨气的家伙……」", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4166", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "深深地叹了一口气。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，纱凪牵起了我的手。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，在你决定之前就这样吧」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4167", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后她开始温柔地抚摸起我的指甲。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，难道说这样做就很像恋人吗？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4168", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用很像，我们本来就是恋人」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……但是，在教室里可没办法这样」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4169", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我倒是无所谓。\\n　就算被班上的同学知道我和纱凪的关系……」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": "「我倒是无所谓。　就算被班上的同学知道我和纱凪的关系……」", "plain_idx": 242, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4170", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我可不行。\\n　刚开始交往了就在他人面前卿卿我我什么的，办不到……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "「……我可不行。　刚开始交往了就在他人面前卿卿我我什么的，办不到……」", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4171", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "考虑到纱凪的性格，她会这样想也是情理之中。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不只是纱凪。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也太在意我们俩成为恋人这件事了。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自然中流露着不自然。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们两人都没有恋爱的经验，\\n就像是刚学走路的小婴儿一样。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "我们两人都没有恋爱的经验，就像是刚学走路的小婴儿一样。", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，我真是个麻烦的女人……」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4172", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有那种事」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在起就让我们两人一起。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一起慢慢向前迈进吧。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和新吾一起走在回家的路上。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明应该是很开心的一件事，但大部分时间脸上都没有笑容。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你冷吗？」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我没事……新吾呢？」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4173", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然纱凪都不冷，那我也没关系」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你、你那是什么逻辑啊」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4174", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到底是什么逻辑呢，我也不太明白」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾一边笑着一边说道，我和这样的他保持着距离。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然趁着势头告白后，我们俩就开始交往了。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我一直都有感到不安。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "作为站在新吾身边的女孩。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……喂，新吾你啊」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4175", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你到底喜欢我的哪一点啊？」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4176", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为感到了不安，所以便决定问问看。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也知道，这一点也不像我的作风。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也不能说是具体喜欢哪一点吧」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就是懵懵懂懂地喜欢上了？」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4177", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是那个意思，因为我对纱凪只有喜欢这一种感情」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，就算出现了和你相貌声音性格相似的女孩子，\\n　我也会认为有所不同」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「所以，就算出现了和你相貌声音性格相似的女孩子，　我也会认为有所不同」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4178", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……又来了。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我又没办法笑出来了。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总感觉……抱歉……」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4179", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦？」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明很开心，但总感觉有些痛苦。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我对自己很没有自信。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以才没有向同学们公开我和新吾的关系。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为害怕。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生和纱凪，真是不般配呢。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "很害怕被别人这样说。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，每当看见新吾的笑容。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就不自觉地感到自卑。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾的身边，肯定更适合美羽学姐那样的人吧。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么要道歉？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不——……我啊，\\n　不是值得别人如此喜欢的女生」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「啊，不——……我啊，　不是值得别人如此喜欢的女生」", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4180", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是过于期待的话，之后可能会很失望……」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4181", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样想了下」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4182", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不用想这些事情啦」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是啊」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4183", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还有啊，抱歉」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然现在已经很喜欢纱凪了。\\n　但我觉得今后肯定会更加喜欢的」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": "「虽然现在已经很喜欢纱凪了。　但我觉得今后肯定会更加喜欢的」", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说这些有点太迟了」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾这样说道，然后不经意地笑了出来。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我没办法再整理好语言。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，有一件事情已经弄清楚了。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……说太迟了什么的，我也一样」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4184", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有新吾的生活，\\n我已经无法想象了。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "没有新吾的生活，我已经无法想象了。", "plain_idx": 319, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
